      <VERS vnumber="4">But now the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>my <gr str="430">God </gr>hath given me <gr str="5117">rest </gr>on every <gr str="5439">side</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">so that there is</STYLE> neither <gr str="7854">adversary </gr>nor <gr str="7451">evil </gr>
